{
  "post": {
    "id": "13184180",
    "published": "2018-05-08T03:12:40.000Z",
    "title": "マイブーム",
    "url": "https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13184180.html",
    "archive": "https://web.archive.org/web/20180518110337/https://lineblog.me/kano/archives/13184180.html",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "こんにちは\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "d9d8b28a0fa2.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00147.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "你好"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Hello"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "最近、カフェ巡りにハマっています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "最近，我迷上了巡游各家咖啡馆。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Lately I've gotten hooked on going around cafes."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2247.JPG",
            "media": "cf3d0b85c8d0.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hgCI3HXfjOGx0ShT7FD1HOzYXPgMNKSJkHjIvVgEcMkIBJi9sHDAtWg4Ueg4vewk-SlY3TlgqDQddOX9JQW0uUhEaOjUlJRpRPFx3FlFOZVhfe3g7SCt3AgRLYV9Yfjo7QS8lAlRKZw"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2273.JPG",
            "media": "81b8fa79361e.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h3__LS1embHBiNUDnA4QTJyBoah8bVnZ4CE17ShdjZl4XWXtwCk95RhhrLhJKRWJANSpiTxtxZB1OB2x_HQ5CED0xMARGTnUlVhV3CkcxMURJBC8uWlojHhViMEBHAW4nV1BxHkVgNQ"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "@新宿"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2198.JPG",
            "media": "b97ec96e547a.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hWzl3AHyICFVRSiTCMXt3AhMXDjooKRJdOzIfbyQcAnskJh9VOTAdYysUSj0cIC1fCmgReHNCDQEfEilzJFwcey0XAyQ-CCpkP3M7L3ROVWF6e0gCZCtHOyYfVmZ8fQoCZC8VO3FOUQ"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2214.JPG",
            "media": "51c3e413a869.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hTq0aC26XC14NGCfJbVh0CU9FDTF0exFWZ2AcZHhOAXB4dBxeZWIeaHdGSRkgSipNNyEUb0xEUgx6VBhAejZFWFxYK2ddUBZMYyIeJCgcVmomKUsJMHlEMH0YVmghKgkJOH0WMC0ZUw"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "@代々木"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@代代木"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "@Yoyogi"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2193.JPG",
            "media": "01cebc307dcf.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h_eqb1df3AEpMGyzdLC1_HQ5GBiU1eBpCJmMXcDlNCmQ5dxdKJGEVfDZFQg1mU0AYEgY1SGBHGgBhaRNmEgAObjxDXSQCKgxvdyROMGkfXX5nKkAdeX1PJDtJXXlnIwIdeX4dJGwfXg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "@原宿"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "東京にせっかく住んでるんだし、カフェ巡りするか〜〜ってなるまで数年かかりました。インドア派なのは変わりませんが、みんなとの話題増やしたいし可愛いものみるとテンションあがるのでしばらくこのマイブームは続きそうです\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "2542fb5d8eac.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00505.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好不容易住在东京，可我却花了好几年才迈出\"那就去巡游咖啡馆吧〜〜\"这一步。虽然我还是个宅女这一点没变，但想和大家多些聊得来的话题，而且看到可爱的东西心情就会嗨起来，所以这个心头好大概还会持续一阵子"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I live in Tokyo, so it took me several years to finally think \"I should go around the cafes~~\". I'm still an indoor person, but I want more things to talk about with you all, and cute things get me excited, so I think this craze will go on for a while."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "みんなの最近のマイブームはなんですか？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家最近的心头好是什么呢？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "What's your current craze, everyone?"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2266.JPG",
            "media": "b3a0b54698b0.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hdY_8fxeLO3ZiQRfh2CREISAcPRkbIiF-CDksTBcXMVgXLSx2CjsuQBgfeSA6Lh90N1gfcBwEHDQUKRhXH1sLQzoiHD4JFQhcF1wjDEdFZkJJcnkoWCV0GBJCY0JPeDkhVyQmRRNCZg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "VnObZ7CVwi.jpg",
            "media": "d2b96f6b7b1a.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0hh3dELlDkNxxZPBuL40ZISxthMXMgXy0UM0QgJixqPTIsUCAcMUYiKiNidXV9CRI6LT8uLnw0YXoqSDMULh08OSxIGW4USwJPZQcFZnw4aihyD3VCY1h4ci5uYS51BDVLbFkqLyg8PA"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "5月12日にデザフェスにでるというのも理由にありますがハンドメイドでちまちまするのも私のマイブームです\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "484a61c9dce8.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00511.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "5月12日要参加 Design Festa 也是原因之一，不过自己动手做手工、一点点打磨小物件，也是我最近的心头好"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "One reason is that I'm appearing at Design Festa on May 12, but doing little handmade crafts bit by bit is also my craze right now."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "484a61c9dce8.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00511.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "484a61c9dce8.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00511.png"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2124.JPG",
            "media": "9c943ac884e7.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h1tqE85sWbltMPELM9sURDA5haDQ1X3RTJkR5YTlqZHU5UHlbJEZ7bTZiLBwCdllQCxhCTyt_TA0gWE8LAwBVZhRINgsTS1RKOQ9fIWk4M29nDy0NcVkhNTw8MmpmDWwMeVlzaD00ZA"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "_var_mobile_Media_DCIM_102APPLE_IMG_2126.JPG",
            "media": "522edde1b5bb.jpg",
            "source": "https://obs.line-scdn.net/0h8joCMapfZ0VSOkvS6MMYEhBnYSorWX1NOEJwfydsbWsnVnBFOkBycyhkJSIDaEVOBzxcJH9yeXQdYmhUKR5BRHNBfyJ-TFBhFRwsP3c-OnF5CSQTb18oKyUyPHN8CGUSZ196diMybQ"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "今年は念願叶って東京ディズニーシーにも行ってきました。暑いのが苦手なので本格的な夏がくる前に隙あらばまたすぐ行きたいなあと画策しています。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "今年也如愿以偿去了东京迪士尼海洋。因为我很怕热，所以正在盘算着趁真正的夏天到来之前，一有空就赶紧再去一趟。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "This year I finally went to Tokyo DisneySea, as I'd long wished to. I'm bad with heat, so I'm scheming to go again soon, the moment I get a chance, before the real summer comes."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "色んなところに行きたいので、おすすめの鹿乃が好きそうな場所があったら教えてください。都内がいいなあ🤭"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "我想去各种各样的地方，如果大家有什么鹿乃可能会喜欢的地方，请推荐给我吧。最好是东京都内的🤭"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I want to go to all sorts of places, so if you know any places you'd recommend that you think Kano would like, please tell me. Somewhere in Tokyo would be nice 🤭"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "鹿乃"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "titleZh": "最近的心头好",
    "titleEn": "My Current Craze"
  },
